WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.967
Slice one point six finishes the design system, and every screen is now built from

00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:08.660
the one shared library.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.693
Fourteen screen-specific copies are gone. The form alert is now the alert, the app

00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:19.628
header is the top bar, and the admin layout is built from the sidebar navigation.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.491
Every member screen starts with a skip link. Then the top bar: the lockup, your

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.042
profile, and Sign out.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.079
The admin console starts with the same skip link. Its sidebar becomes a band below a

00:00:33.079 --> 00:00:37.188
thousand and twenty-four pixels, the links scrolling within it.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.328
Your profile is now container, split, avatar, lists and tags. Loading and failing

00:00:43.328 --> 00:00:46.259
use the shared skeleton and empty state.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.010
Sign in and Join take the shared alert, links and interest list. A busy button draws

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.264
its own spinner.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.655
The tab bar, breadcrumb and footer wait for the screens that need them, each proven

00:01:00.655 --> 00:01:01.909
by its own tests.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.654
Every Playwright spec passes, asserting what it did before, and both apps start

00:01:08.654 --> 00:01:10.015
exactly as before.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.061
That's slice one point six. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:17.061 --> 00:01:18.348
body and spirit.
